sequenceDiagram
    title Quản lý chương trình khuyến mãi và voucher
    actor Employee
    participant AdminPortal
    participant API
    participant PromotionService
    participant PostgreSQL

    Employee->>AdminPortal: Tạo chương trình khuyến mãi
    AdminPortal->>API: POST /promotions
    API->>PromotionService: Validate dates and status
    PromotionService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT promotion
    PostgreSQL-->>PromotionService: Promotion record
    API-->>AdminPortal: 201 promotion
    Employee->>AdminPortal: Tạo voucher trong chương trình
    AdminPortal->>API: POST /promotions/:promotionId/vouchers
    API->>PromotionService: Normalize code and validate rules
    PromotionService->>PostgreSQL: Check unique voucher code
    PostgreSQL-->>PromotionService: Code available
    PromotionService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT promotion_detail
    PostgreSQL-->>PromotionService: Voucher record
    API-->>AdminPortal: 201 voucher
    Employee->>AdminPortal: Cập nhật hoặc vô hiệu hóa voucher
    AdminPortal->>API: PATCH /promotions/:promotionId/vouchers/:voucherId
    API->>PromotionService: Validate update and usage constraints
    PromotionService->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE voucher
    PostgreSQL-->>PromotionService: Updated voucher
    API-->>AdminPortal: 200 voucher
